es/companies_302.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/companies/companies_302.png","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/3dcujoGPSj9Lr9Hy6","source_page":"/meta/companies/gasStations"}],"tips":[{"id":"dYhG","text":["These four **gas station brands** are common to Denmark, but each are shared between one other country:","- [**Ingo**](https://goo.gl/maps/gzK5cAGTik4myC2t6) can be found in Denmark and Sweden.","- [**Ok**](https://goo.gl/maps/ZnQyP9LSGm32coji9) can be found in Denmark and the Netherlands.","- [**Uno-X**](https://goo.gl/maps/N7BtoCnkt2mgQe5HA) and [**Yx**](https://goo.gl/maps/MnuSF8c2GA8ujdW19) can be found in Denmark and Norway."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/denmark/Gas_Station_Brands.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/ue4NuoAibsmbyij88","clues":["gas_stations"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"denmark","country_name":"Denmark"},{"id":"LMob","text":["**OXXO** and **Pemex** are two of the most popular gas station brands in Mexico.","NOTE: While less common, OXXO can still be found in [other countries](https://www.google.com/maps/@-33.4481518,-70.5764202,3a,15y,199.57h,89.44t,1.18r/data=!3m7!1e1!3m5!1sJaAVdAE4oby9-yp1rsx3PQ!2e0!5s20230501T000000!7i16384!8i8192?entry=ttu)."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/mexico/mx_brands.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/zRUiMrqgaYkDDNuFA","clues":["gas_stations"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"mexico","country_name":"Mexico"},{"id":"CZYl","text":["Pictured here is a group of **gas stations** and **convenience store** chains that operate **in the United States**, but **not in Canada**. This is not a comprehensive list, but some of the most common American-only chains. "],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/united-states/american_gas_station_only_chains.webp","link":"","clues":["gas_stations"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States of America"},{"id":"fDFh","text":["‘**WaWa**’ is a regional gas station and convenience store chain with locations in the Mid-Atlantic states and Florida. New Jersey and the Philadelphia, Pennsylvania area have the highest density of locations."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/united-states/13wawa_locs.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/CMHCiSYF1aU6KjDT9","clues":["gas_stations"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States of America"},{"id":"3Trb","text":["Another regional gas station and convenience store chain in the Eastern US is called ‘**Sheetz**’. Most of their locations are in the Mid-Atlantic and Central Appalachian areas of the US. Pennsylvania has the highest number of locations."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/united-states/14sheetz_locs.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/275v2Fza6DMj5A5S9","clues":["gas_stations"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States of America"},{"id":"6MhQ","text":["‘**Kwik Trip**’ is a chain of gas stations and convenience stores that are located in the Upper Midwest states of Wisconsin and Minnesota. In Iowa, these stores are called ‘[**Kwik Star**](https://goo.gl/maps/6MgdfZ1ey134z9Yi6)’ and have similar branding. Some stores may also have the name ‘[Stop-N-Go](https://maps.app.goo.gl/KXXGnVPs4aBiXU39A)’."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/united-states/15kwik_trip_locs.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/Lj4DwmYHJuMgxQNS9","clues":["gas_stations"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States of America"},{"id":"1MNA","text":["‘**Kum & Go**’ is a regional gas station chain based out of the state of Iowa. They also have pockets of locations in the Ozarks, Colorado, Wyoming, and North Dakota."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/united-states/17Kum_N_go_locs.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/bJ1Yv7TWAacGoUpC6","clues":["gas_stations"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States of America"},{"id":"h1bS","text":["‘**Casey’s**’ is a popular gas station and convenience store chain that is found in the Midwest, Plains, and parts of the Mid-South. Illinois, Iowa, and Missouri have the highest number of locations."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/united-states/16caseys_locs.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/dzLDfweiZPsd3iDd9","clues":["gas_stations"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States of America"},{"id":"PPTf","text":["‘**Buc-ee’s**’ is a small chain of oversized gas stations located primarily in the state of Texas. These stores feature multiple rows of gas pumps, and a very large convenience store building.","NOTE: Some other nearby states have Buc-ee’s locations, but they are quite rare outside of Texas."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/united-states/18bucees_locs.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/x3c2HJ3j2BgZAx6g8","clues":["gas_stations","architecture"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States of America"}],"gallery_count":78,"tip_count":9}